  steps:
    1. Create 15x15 grid filled with background color (pick from non-green, non-yellow)
    2. Pick 1 foreground color (not bg, not green, not yellow)
    3. Place 3 non-overlapping rectangles with >=1 margin from grid border and pairwise Chebyshev distance >=3
